<title>RUSSIA: Deutsche BA stops flights to Russia from April 1.</title>
<headline>Deutsche BA stops flights to Russia from April 1.</headline>
<dateline>ST PETERSBURG, Russia 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutche BA, a unit of British Airways, will cease regular flights to Russia from next month due to changes in its international policy, a BA official in St Petersburg said on Monday.</p>
<p>Olga Kiselyova told Reuters that Deutche would halt its flights from Berlin to Moscow and to St Petersburg.</p>
<p>Deutche BA currently makes six weekly flights to Moscow and five weekly flights to Russia's second city.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 85 20</p>
</text>
